{{define "html"}}<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>{{template "subject" .}}</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold">{{.Org}}</p>
<p>{{.Params.GivenName}} has sent a consultation request from the landing page.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;border-collapse:collapse">
<tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;vertical-align:top">Interested in</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-weight:bold">{{template "interests" .Params.Interests}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;vertical-align:top">Course for</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-weight:bold">{{template "courseFor" .Params.CourseFor}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;vertical-align:top">Best time to call</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-weight:bold">{{template "callTime" .Params.CallTime}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;vertical-align:top">Received</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-weight:bold">{{template "receivedAt" .}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p>The full name and the phone number are in the Admin console. Open the request to call back:</p>
<p><a href="{{.Link}}">Open the consultation request</a></p>
<p style="font-size:14px;word-break:break-all">{{.Link}}</p>
<p>Sign in with an Admin account. This message does not hold the sender's phone number.</p>
